[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15840.07, "timestamp": "04:24:00", "text": "我又想尝试一些东西了，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15842.71, "timestamp": "04:24:02", "text": "再次强调，有很多人使用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15846.67, "timestamp": "04:24:06", "text": "普通的蓝色麦克风，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15850.71, "timestamp": "04:24:10", "text": "就像ASMR一样，所以是的，我会坚持下去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15854.189, "timestamp": "04:24:14", "text": "无论我拥有什么，我都喜欢改进。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15860.229, "timestamp": "04:24:20", "text": "但我做ASMR的时候就觉得可以，所以就答应了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15861.51, "timestamp": "04:24:21", "text": "我的天啊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15864.63, "timestamp": "04:24:24", "text": "但再想想ASMR，对吧？一次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15867.429, "timestamp": "04:24:27", "text": "一旦你深入了解之后，你就会明白这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15868.67, "timestamp": "04:24:28", "text": "感觉如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15871.91, "timestamp": "04:24:31", "text": "上瘾会让你想要去做某件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15874.189, "timestamp": "04:24:34", "text": "越来越多，而且"}]